<title>GERMANY: Villeroy &amp; Boch H1 profit at 5.1 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Villeroy &amp; Boch H1 profit at 5.1 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>METTLACH, Germany 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     5.1     vs 43.5</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    20.2    vs 54.8</p>
<p>    Group sales				  718.3   vs 762.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German tableware and bathroom fittings group is Villeroy &amp; Boch AG. The group also said that it expects ongoing pressure on results and said it would take appropriate steps. The group also said it expected more writedowns and higher reserves this year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
